00:40:53.000 --> 00:40:55.250
shorter leg and then multiplied by the

00:40:55.250 --> 00:40:56.600
square root of 3 to get the longer leg

00:40:56.600 --> 00:40:58.490
they give you the longer leg you divide

00:40:58.490 --> 00:40:59.510
by the square root of 3 to get the

00:40:59.510 --> 00:41:01.400
shorter leg and then double to get the

00:41:01.400 --> 00:41:03.440
hypotenuse so that's a quick overview of

00:41:03.440 --> 00:41:06.560
the 30-60-90 45-45-90 let's look at a

00:41:06.560 --> 00:41:09.020
couple examples here so this one we're

