00:41:46.730 --> 00:41:49.250
giving us the hypotenuse 10 so we have

00:41:49.250 --> 00:41:51.260
to divide by the square root of 2 to get

00:41:51.260 --> 00:41:53.780
back to the leg so if we rationalize

00:41:53.780 --> 00:41:56.810
again for this one we get 10 square root

00:41:56.810 --> 00:41:57.910
of 2 over 2

00:41:57.910 --> 00:42:00.400
the 10 of the to reduce and we just get

00:42:00.400 --> 00:42:05.500
5 square root of 2 so try and remember

00:42:05.500 --> 00:42:07.870
and memorize and review these special

