perimeter area and volume so we'll just

00:42:37.690 --> 00:42:39.160
go over the formulas real quick here and

00:42:39.160 --> 00:42:41.560
that's for a circle you want to know the

00:42:41.560 --> 00:42:43.630
circumference two PI R or pi times

00:42:43.630 --> 00:42:45.460
diameter and the area equals PI R

00:42:45.460 --> 00:42:48.760
squared a trapezoid you add the two

00:42:48.760 --> 00:42:51.550
bases these are the parallel sides times

00:42:51.550 --> 00:42:52.780
the height that's the perpendicular

00:42:52.780 --> 00:42:54.370
