00:43:39.130 --> 00:43:41.500
trick to it and that's that they'll give

00:43:41.500 --> 00:43:42.760
you some of these dimensions but what

00:43:42.760 --> 00:43:44.470
you can do is you can think of these

00:43:44.470 --> 00:43:47.260
pieces as being separated or

00:43:47.260 --> 00:43:49.210
