00:45:00.460 --> 00:45:02.410
if you place that axe on top of that X

00:45:02.410 --> 00:45:04.930
the angles that match up those are

00:45:04.930 --> 00:45:06.339
called corresponding angles and those

00:45:06.339 --> 00:45:07.920
angles will be congruent to each other

00:45:07.920 --> 00:45:10.180
the other two that we want to pay

00:45:10.180 --> 00:45:11.529
attention to are the alternate interior

00:45:11.529 --> 00:45:15.069
angles that's like 3 &amp; 6 4 &amp; 5 interior

00:45:15.069 --> 00:45:16.869
means are in between alternate means

00:45:16.869 --> 00:45:18.940
ones on the left ones on the right so

00:45:18.940 --> 00:45:20.410
these are alternate interior and those

